item.text:
The 2022 record for Chapter 4B is structurally authoritarian: the formal constitution concentrates election supervision, judicial/media appointments, and emergency power at the top, while the 2022 protest wave shows Khamenei and the state treating dissent as an enemy action and responding with arrests, censorship, and digital control. The local prior already shows the democratic indices near floor, so I focused on ruler-attributed mechanisms rather than re-fetching structured datasets.

